  "description": {
    "text": "The 2009 fall Collector's Tins, released on 2 September 2009, each held two Supreme Victors booster packs, one Rising Rivals and one Diamond & Pearl series pack, and a holofoil LV.X: Charizard G LV.X DP45, Garchomp C LV.X DP46 or Rayquaza C LV.X DP47, each the Supreme Victors card with a new drawing used only outside Japan. Some American tins were reported to hold German copies of the LV.X cards. Repackaged tins sold only at Walgreens from November 2010 held three booster packs and a Cracked Ice holofoil Charizard, Garchomp or Rayquaza C instead of the LV.X.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Platinum TCG Series merchandise",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Platinum_TCG_Series_merchandise"
      },
